  "title": "IAM examines the Unified Patent Court’s impact on legal finance",
  "summary": "IAM features an article in its recent Special Report on the strategic and commercial impact of the Unified Patent Court, examining what the UPC means for legal finance. The contribution, authored by Managing Director Christopher Freeman, explores how the new court may shape funding structures, risk allocation and decision-making in European patent disputes. Learn more.",
